{"id":"wb-8-403","name":"高州宝光塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宝光塔","text":"宝光塔，俗称“粉塔”，位于中国广东省茂名市高州市宝光街道西岸村宝光公园内，是一座八角九层楼阁式砖塔，也是高州的地标性建筑，与城东文光塔（文笔塔）、城北艮塔并称“高州三塔”。该塔沿鉴江而立，建于明万历四年（1576年），通高65.8米，是广东省内最高的楼阁式塔，1989年被列为广东省文物保护单位，2019年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%85%89%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95189170,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95189170","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6b153dc23a06bcc440c27821.jpg","title":"Baoguang_Towel.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Baoguang_Towel.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Baoguang_Towel.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Pv163","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​高州宝光塔","width":320,"height":426}}